        "Missing open enrollment means waiting for the next enrollment period unless you're 66+ and recently moved to Massachusetts, lost coverage, or became ineligible for Medicaid",
        "Asset limits only apply if you're also applying for Medicare Extra Help or Medicare Savings Program, most Prescription Advantage applicants have no asset limits",
        "The program has five income tiers (S0-S5) with different benefit levels, lower tiers receive more assistance with premiums and copayments"
