          "question": "Can my loved one keep their house and still qualify?",
          "answer": "Yes, home ownership typically doesn't disqualify your loved one from Home Care Program. The program focuses on income limits rather than asset limits, especially for MassHealth members. Property taxes and home maintenance costs may actually support their case for needing assistance."
